  "body": "- chore(deps): update dependency dprint to v0.57.0 [`#2916`](https://github.com/ast-grep/ast-grep/pull/2916)\n- feat: add min-severity cli [`#2917`](https://github.com/ast-grep/ast-grep/pull/2917)\n- fix(outline): anchor fallback signatures to names [`#2913`](https://github.com/ast-grep/ast-grep/pull/2913)\n- feat(outline): add Markdown heading support [`#2912`](https://github.com/ast-grep/ast-grep/pull/2912)\n- chore(deps): update dependency oxlint to v1.80.0 [`#2908`](https://github.com/ast-grep/ast-grep/pull/2908)\n- chore(deps): update dependency @ast-grep/napi to v0.45.2 [`#2906`](https://github.com/ast-grep/ast-grep/pull/2906)\n- feat: add min-severity cli (#2917) [`#2720`](https://github.com/ast-grep/ast-grep/issues/2720)\n- fix: ast-grep-ignore must be at first be the frist alphabet to take effect [`#2909`](https://github.com/ast-grep/ast-grep/issues/2909)\n- chore: update tree-sitter 0.27 [`bb74529`](https://github.com/ast-grep/ast-grep/commit/bb745292b5e683822c27612858b5b0edb54e273e)\n- fix: fix clippy [`c6b32d7`](https://github.com/ast-grep/ast-grep/commit/c6b32d74ad12cea690cb331c88f004764df6e985)"
